          "kicker": "Scoring gap",
          "heading": "Fiji have conceded 408 points in their last 11 games",
          "body": "Across their last 11 games Fiji have scored 273 points, averaging 24.8 points a game. Their defensive numbers in the same window are the harder read: 37.1 points conceded a game on average. Their biggest win in that span was a 45-29 home victory over Canada in September, in the Pacific Nations Cup knockout stage."
