          "kicker": "Column verdict",
          "heading": "Paul Williams says England's pack is under-appreciated after Australia win",
          "body": "Rugby World columnist Paul Williams argues England's players are under-rated after the 45-22 win over Australia in the Nations Championship, a performance he says drew a tepid response. Japan are next up on Saturday. He singles out the tight five as an industrial-level unit, names back-rower Ben Earl as the top carrier across the competition so far, and praises fly-half Fin Smith's close passing."
