    "391": {
      "date": "2026-11-12",
      "edition": "Thursday 12 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Back-row selection",
          "heading": "Aaron Wainwright set to miss All Blacks test; Taine Basham poised",
          "body": "Taine Basham looks poised to get his chance in the back row against New Zealand on Saturday, with Aaron Wainwright set to miss the match. The Cardiff No 8 has 17 Wales caps, the last won against England in 2024, and WalesOnline argues he offers the explosive ball-carrying that Wales have lacked over the past 12 months, a gap the 28-21 win over Japan last Saturday did little to close. He was player of the match in the 29-28 win over Australia in 2021."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "France recall Alldritt at No. 8 after almost a year out",
