    "460": {
      "date": "2026-11-12",
      "edition": "Thursday 12 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Julián Montoya out of Italy clash after HIA; Contepomi adds Bosch, Bernasconi",
          "body": "Captain Julián Montoya, who left early against Ireland in Dublin, is out for 12 days under HIA protocols and misses Saturday's test in Genoa. Replacement Leonel Oviedo also went through HIA assessments, and his fitness remains unclear. Head coach Felipe Contepomi's two new hookers, Bosch, last capped in 2021, and Bernasconi, on three caps, may both make the 23, while uncapped Tobías Wade is looking for a first cap at fullback."
        },
