      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Winger backing",
          "heading": "Ryan Lonergan defends Joseph Suaalii after Chris Ashton's 'unfair' criticism",
          "body": "Wallabies scrum-half Ryan Lonergan has defended winger Joseph Suaalii against Chris Ashton, the former England winger, who told the BBC that the ex-rugby league star did not look like an international union player. Lonergan said Suaalii had been given few chances in the 45-22 defeat at Twickenham, and that Australia's problems were on the inside. \"I think that's probably a little bit unfair on 'Su.'\" He added that the collision battle was the main point from the team's defensive review ahead of Sunday's Scotland match."
        },
