          "kicker": "Underdog plan",
          "heading": "Eddie Jones says Japan will seek chaos and upset at Twickenham",
          "body": "Japan head coach Eddie Jones is drawing on Italy's example, who beat England in March for the first time in 33 attempts, and wants Saturday's Test at Allianz Stadium to turn into chaos. Speaking to BBC Radio 5 Live, he said: \"We're massive underdogs,\" and argued Japan must disrupt England, get the crowd booing and let the pressure build. Japan have lost all six previous Tests against England, most recently 54-19 two years ago."
        },
